# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# IMPORTANT: sources must be ROOT-RELATIVE PATHS. Cloudflare Pages ignores any
# rule whose source is a full URL, so host-level redirects (www -> apex,
# altaherdesign.com -> altaherdesign.ae) CANNOT live here. Those are configured
# as Redirect Rules in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   Rules > Redirect Rules > "Redirect from www"
#   When: hostname equals www.altaherdesign.ae
#   Then: 301 -> concat("https://altaherdesign.ae", http.request.uri.path)
#
# Retired paths -> current equivalents
/index.html            /                    301
/all-services/         /services/           301
/all-services          /services/           301
/ar/all-services/      /ar/services/        301
/ar/all-services       /ar/services/        301
